# Pet-Owner (holder) wallet - environment.
#
# The wallet has no backend. src/lib/config.ts supplies the guarded ROAX RPC default; Settings can
# persist another peer only for the same bundled chain. There is no user-configurable provider
# directory/indexer endpoint.

# ---- Deployed contract addresses --------------------------------------------------------------
# The owner-hidden VerificationRegistryConsent - the sole emitter of the owner-blind `Verified`
# events the consent-history surface scans. Ships BLANK with no code fallback; the value lives in
# contracts/deployments/roax.json.
#
# A WRONG value here is silent in the worst way: a superseded registry still answers eth_getLogs
# perfectly well, so it renders as an owner who has consented to nothing, forever. Unset is at least
# legible as unconfigured.
#
# OPERATOR-configurable, never HOLDER-configurable. A holder who could repoint this could change what
# "genuine" means, and a forged registry verifies forged credentials cleanly with every check passing.
VITE_VERIFICATION_REGISTRY_CONSENT_ADDR=
